### ClearWood Furnitures — Prompt 6: pricing engine
### VS Code REST Client. Runs top to bottom; @variables carry state forward.

@host = http://localhost:7180
@api = {{host}}/api/v1
@slug = kabir-3-seater-fabric-sofa

### ------------------------------------------------------------ public API
### (Prompt 5) Public quotes price reachable products only: a draft, hidden, scheduled or deleted
### product answers 404. A signed-in member of a group with `discountBp` sees it applied once, as
### a CUSTOMER_GROUP component after every rule (engineVersion 2).

### 1. Product price, single unit, no context
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/{{slug}}/price

### 2. Product price with options, a quantity tier, a pincode and a coupon
# @name productPrice
GET {{api}}/catalog/products/{{slug}}/price?qty=5&pincode=400001&couponCode=WELCOME10

### The breakdown's components must sum exactly to grandTotalPaise.
@productId = {{productPrice.response.body.data.lines.0.productId}}

### 3. Cart quote — two lines, one coupon, one delivery address
# @name quote
POST {{api}}/pricing/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "slug": "kabir-3-seater-fabric-sofa", "qty": 1 },
    { "slug": "ortho-zen-pocket-spring-mattress", "qty": 2 }
  ],
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10",
  "pincode": "400001",
  "channel": "WEB"
}

### 4. Coupon validation — success
POST {{api}}/pricing/validate-coupon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "WELCOME10",
  "items": [{ "slug": "{{slug}}", "qty": 1 }],
  "pincode": "400001"
}

### 5. Coupon validation — failure (expired campaign; expect isValid:false, code EXPIRED)
POST {{api}}/pricing/validate-coupon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "EXPIRED2025",
  "items": [{ "slug": "{{slug}}", "qty": 1 }]
}

### 6. Coupon validation — failure (unknown code; expect NOT_FOUND)
POST {{api}}/pricing/validate-coupon
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "NOPE404",
  "items": [{ "slug": "{{slug}}", "qty": 1 }]
}

### 7. Serviceability — a served metro pincode
GET {{api}}/shipping/serviceability/400001

### 8. Serviceability — an unserved pincode
GET {{api}}/shipping/serviceability/999999

### 9. Serviceability — a malformed pincode (expect 422)
GET {{api}}/shipping/serviceability/12ab

### ------------------------------------------------------------- admin API

### 10. Sign in (sets cw_adm_at / cw_adm_rt / cw_adm_csrf)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{api}}/admin/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@clearwood.local",
  "password": "ChangeMe@12345"
}

###
@csrf = {{adminLogin.response.headers.$['set-cookie'][2]}}

### 11. Simulate with a full rule trace (matched AND unmatched rules with reasons)
POST {{api}}/admin/pricing/simulate
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "items": [{ "productId": "{{productId}}", "qty": 5 }],
  "couponCode": "WELCOME10",
  "pincode": "400001",
  "includeTrace": true
}

### 12. Explain every rule that could ever touch one product
GET {{api}}/admin/pricing/explain/{{productId}}

### 13. Pricing settings
GET {{api}}/admin/pricing/settings

### 14. Create a coupon
# @name newCoupon
POST {{api}}/admin/pricing/coupons
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
Idempotency-Key: coupon-create-http-001

{
  "code": "HTTPDOC15",
  "name": "REST client demo — 15% off",
  "type": "PERCENT",
  "valueBp": 1500,
  "minSubtotalPaise": 500000,
  "maxDiscountPaise": 300000,
  "usageLimit": 100,
  "perCustomerLimit": 1,
  "isActive": true
}

###
@couponId = {{newCoupon.response.body.data.id}}

### 15. Redemption list for that coupon
GET {{api}}/admin/pricing/coupons/{{couponId}}/redemptions

### 16. Deactivate it (optimistic locking — version must match)
PATCH {{api}}/admin/pricing/coupons/{{couponId}}
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}

{
  "isActive": false,
  "version": {{newCoupon.response.body.data.version}}
}

### 17. Re-run the public quote — the cache must already be invalidated
POST {{api}}/pricing/quote
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [{ "slug": "{{slug}}", "qty": 1 }],
  "couponCode": "HTTPDOC15"
}

### 18. Clean up
DELETE {{api}}/admin/pricing/coupons/{{couponId}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrf}}
